
# Excel Tarot Spreads

This is an Excel Application for creating Tarot speads.

## Screenshots

You can include images in a GitHub README using Markdown's image syntax:

```markdown
![Description of image](images/tarot-spread.png)
```

For example:

![Tarot Spread](images/tarot-spread.png)

Alternatively, you can use HTML to control the image dimensions:

```html
<img src="images/tarot-spread.png" alt="Tarot Spread" width="600">
```

## Project Contents

- Excel workbook containing the Tarot application.
- VBA modules supporting the application.
- Images and other supporting resources.
